//    other private siblings. The current comment lists 7 internal
//    modules; ocap_to_oodar.oo is the 8th. ~5 lines, no behavior
//    change.
// 2. Consider extending the audit framework's status taxonomy
//    to include CROSS-REPO. Currently the audit flags the bridge
//    shim as RESIDUAL, which is correct but loses the cross-repo
